      {
        "id": "textbook-opencv-api",
        "moduleId": "opencv-practice",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材：cv.cornerHarris 的参数与示例",
        "markdown": "OpenCV 用 **cv.cornerHarris()** 实现上述过程，参数含义为：\n\n- **img**：输入图像，必须是灰度、`float32` 类型；\n- **blockSize**：角点检测所考虑的邻域大小；\n- **ksize**：所用 Sobel 导数的孔径参数；\n- **k**：响应函数中的 Harris 自由参数。\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport cv2 as cv\n\nimg = cv.imread('chessboard.png')\ngray = cv.cvtColor(img, cv.COLOR_BGR2GRAY)\ngray = np.float32(gray)\ndst = cv.cornerHarris(gray, 2, 3, 0.04)\n\ndst = cv.dilate(dst, None)\nimg[dst > 0.01 * dst.max()] = [0, 0, 255]\n```\n\n上例中 `dst` 是分数图，膨胀只为标记更醒目；阈值取分数最大值的 0.01 倍，教材指出这个值需要按图像调整。",
